Subject: [PATCH] d3d11: opt in to nonblocking staged buffer polling

diff --git a/src/d3d11/gpu.c b/src/d3d11/gpu.c
index a4a003dc..ac424cdd 100644
--- a/src/d3d11/gpu.c
+++ b/src/d3d11/gpu.c
